{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model with multiprofile setting, using PCA-reduced RNA data, ResNet50 image features, average pooling aggregation, and concatenation fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.6186 exceeds the singleprofile multimodal baseline (0.5266), suggesting multiprofile may improve performance. However, the role of aggregation and fusion strategies in this improvement remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative configurations."
}

